message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  paper describing the underlying method.
title: "lifelines-hc"
abstract: >-
  Higher Criticism (HCHG) tests for detecting sparse, non-proportional
  hazard deviations in two-sample right-censored survival data, implemented
  as an extension of the lifelines survival library.
type: software
